            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Esteban O, Birman D, Schaer M, Koyejo OO, Poldrack RA, et al. (2017) MRIQC: Advancing the automatic prediction of image quality in MRI from unseen sites. PLOS ONE 12(9): e0184661. https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0184661",
